### Admin API — koleksi request (ekstensi VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Isi variabel di bawah. Key admin: scripts\manage.py create-admin-key --name bootstrap
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@admin = lgw_GANTI_DENGAN_KEY_ADMIN
@project = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@key = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- projects
GET {{base}}/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Buat project (slug ^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{1,62}$) + pola model sekaligus
POST {{base}}/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "agent-riset",
  "name": "Agent Riset",
  "owner": "tim-data",
  "log_payloads": false,
  "payload_retention_days": 7,
  "image_retention_days": 7,
  "allowed_models": ["smart", "code", "autocomplete", "anthropic/*", "openai/*", "local/*"]
}

###
GET {{base}}/admin/projects/{{project}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### PATCH: If-Match opsional (updated_at terakhir) → 409 bila data berubah
PATCH {{base}}/admin/projects/{{project}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "suspended"}

### Arsipkan (soft delete) + revoke semua key
DELETE {{base}}/admin/projects/{{project}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Ganti seluruh pola model/route yang diizinkan (glob). Route DAN kandidatnya harus cocok.
PUT {{base}}/admin/projects/{{project}}/allowed-models
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"patterns": ["smart", "code", "anthropic/*", "openai/*", "local/*"]}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- keys
GET {{base}}/admin/projects/{{project}}/keys
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Respons memuat "key" SEKALI (tidak disimpan)
POST {{base}}/admin/projects/{{project}}/keys
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "dev", "scopes": ["chat", "completions", "images", "models:read", "usage:read"], "rpm_limit": 60}

###
POST {{base}}/admin/keys/{{key}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "bocor di repo"}

###
POST {{base}}/admin/keys/{{key}}/rotate
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- kuota
GET {{base}}/admin/projects/{{project}}/quotas
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
PUT {{base}}/admin/projects/{{project}}/quotas
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quotas": [
  {"period": "daily", "max_requests": 2000, "max_cost_usd": "5.00"},
  {"period": "monthly", "max_tokens": 50000000, "max_images": 500}
]}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- providers
GET {{base}}/admin/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
PATCH {{base}}/admin/providers/openai
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"timeout_seconds": 120, "max_concurrency": 16}

###
POST {{base}}/admin/providers/openvino/test
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Provider API pihak ketiga (OpenAI-compatible). Isi DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=... di .env lalu restart.
POST {{base}}/admin/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "deepseek",
  "display_name": "DeepSeek",
  "adapter": "openai",
  "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com/v1",
  "api_key_env": "DEEPSEEK_API_KEY"
}

### Provider tanpa API key (Ollama / vLLM di LAN)
POST {{base}}/admin/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ollama-lan",
  "display_name": "Ollama LAN",
  "adapter": "openai",
  "base_url": "http://192.168.1.50:11434/v1",
  "config": {"auth": "none"}
}

### Model di provider custom (alias <provider>/<nama>; harga USD per 1 juta token = CONTOH,
### cek nama model & harga terbaru di dokumentasi provider)
POST {{base}}/admin/models
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alias": "deepseek/chat",
  "provider": "deepseek",
  "upstream_name": "deepseek-chat",
  "model_type": "chat",
  "tier": "light",
  "supports_tools": true,
  "supports_json_mode": true,
  "input_cost_per_mtok": "0.27",
  "output_cost_per_mtok": "1.10"
}

### Uji koneksi provider custom
POST {{base}}/admin/providers/deepseek/test
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Hapus provider (409 bila masih punya model)
DELETE {{base}}/admin/providers/ollama-lan
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- models
GET {{base}}/admin/models
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Tambah model remote (harga per 1 juta token)
POST {{base}}/admin/models
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alias": "openai/gpt-mini",
  "provider": "openai",
  "upstream_name": "gpt-5-mini",
  "model_type": "chat",
  "tier": "light",
  "supports_tools": true,
  "supports_vision": true,
  "supports_json_mode": true,
  "input_cost_per_mtok": "0.25",
  "output_cost_per_mtok": "2.00"
}

### Model lokal: pin (total pinned per device ≤ budget, else 422), device bukan cpu
PATCH {{base}}/admin/models/local/qwen2.5-coder-1.5b
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"is_pinned": true}

### Nonaktifkan (disarankan daripada hapus bila masih dipakai route)
PATCH {{base}}/admin/models/openai/gpt-mini
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"is_enabled": false}

### 409 bila masih dipakai route
DELETE {{base}}/admin/models/openai/gpt-mini
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- routes
GET {{base}}/admin/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
POST {{base}}/admin/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alias": "hemat",
  "description": "murah dulu, lokal sebagai cadangan",
  "strategy": "priority",
  "config": {"prefer_loaded": true},
  "targets": [
    {"model_alias": "openai/gpt-light", "priority": 1},
    {"model_alias": "local/qwen2.5-7b", "priority": 2}
  ]
}

###
PATCH {{base}}/admin/routes/hemat
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"strategy": "round_robin", "targets": [
  {"model_alias": "openai/gpt-light", "priority": 1, "weight": 3},
  {"model_alias": "gemini/flash", "priority": 1, "weight": 1}
]}

###
DELETE {{base}}/admin/routes/hemat
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- penelusuran
### Filter: project_id, api_key_id, status, endpoint, model, provider, device,
### caller_task, caller_agent, from, to (ISO); paginasi cursor (limit ≤ 200)
GET {{base}}/admin/requests?caller_task=research-42&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Detail request + attempts + payload (bila log_payloads & belum kedaluwarsa)
GET {{base}}/admin/requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### group_by = day | project | model | provider
GET {{base}}/admin/usage?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&group_by=project
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Konsistensi requests vs usage_daily (selisih harus 0)
GET {{base}}/admin/usage/verify?day=2026-10-28
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
GET {{base}}/admin/audit-logs?entity_type=project&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- runtime lokal
GET {{base}}/admin/runtime/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Warmup sebelum jam sibuk (pin=true hanya sampai runtime restart)
POST {{base}}/admin/runtime/models/local/qwen2.5-7b/load?pin=false
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 409 bila pinned / sedang dipakai; force=true menunggu maks 60 detik
POST {{base}}/admin/runtime/models/local/qwen2.5-7b/unload?force=false
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
GET {{base}}/admin/runtime/events?event=evict&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
GET {{base}}/admin/runtime/swap-stats?from=2026-10-28T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- operasional
### Reload registry gateway + katalog runtime + kosongkan cache auth/kuota
POST {{base}}/admin/cache/reload
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Retensi manual (TASK-19)
POST {{base}}/admin/maintenance/retention
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
